      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "An information system on the results of clinical examination of patients with chronic ischemic heart disease is described. The bulk of information contains data on 590 patients who had undergone coronarography. A standarized chart of block structure of the comprehensive examination of the patient was used to obtain full and homogeneous information. With this information system large volumes of data may be grouped and stored, available whenever necessary, data may be selected from the overall material, and groups of patients may be formed according to some predetermined sign or complex of signs."},
